  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"291\" id=\"isPasted\">🤝 <strong data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"291\">Naidaimrktplace Affiliate Program</strong></h3><h4 data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"330\"><strong data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"330\">About Our Brand and Products</strong></h4><p data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"648\">Naidaimrktplace is Kenya’s modern lifestyle and tech marketplace, offering a wide range of <strong data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"467\">smart, stylish, and affordable essentials</strong>. From innovative home and kitchen tools to trending gadgets, decor, and fitness gear, our products are designed to make everyday life simpler and more enjoyable across East Africa.</p><h4 data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"682\"><strong data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"682\">What Makes Us Different</strong></h4><p data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"1061\">We blend <strong data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"758\">modern design, fast local delivery, and customer-first service</strong> to create an experience that’s both premium and accessible. Every product we feature is carefully selected for quality and practicality, giving affiliates full confidence when promoting our brand. Our growing reputation in Kenya and beyond makes Naidaimrktplace a strong partner for long-term earnings.</p><h4 data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1095\"><strong data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1095\">How Affiliates Can Earn</strong></h4><p data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1469\">Affiliates earn a <strong data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1141\">10% commission per sale</strong> through their unique referral links tracked via the&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1216\">UpPromote platform</strong>.<br data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1220\">Commissions are <strong data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1274\">automatically tracked and credited</strong> for every verified purchase — with no earning limits. The more referrals you bring, the higher your total income. UpPromote ensures real-time performance reports and transparent monthly payouts.</p><h4 data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1497\"><strong data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1497\">How to Promote Us</strong></h4><p data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1556\">Affiliates can promote Naidaimrktplace in multiple ways:</p><ul data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1914\"><li data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1654\"><p data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1654\">Share referral links or product showcases on <strong data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1651\">Instagram, Facebook, X, TikTok, and YouTube</strong>.</p></li><li data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1758\"><p data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1758\">Create <strong data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1720\">content reviews, unboxings, or trend recommendations</strong> featuring Naidaimrktplace products.</p></li><li data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1847\"><p data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1847\">Use <strong data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1809\">UpPromote-provided banners and creatives</strong> on blogs, websites, or newsletters.</p></li><li data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1914\"><p data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1914\">Leverage <strong data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1890\">seasonal and viral products</strong> to boost conversions.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"2034\">We support our partners with marketing resources, promotions, and campaign updates to help them perform at their best.</p><h4 data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2062\"><strong data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2062\">Other Information</strong></h4><ul data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2347\"><li data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2100\"><p data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2100\"><strong data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2085\">Commission Rate:</strong> 10% per sale</p></li><li data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2164\"><p data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2164\"><strong data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2126\">Affiliate Platform:</strong> UpPromote (integrated with Shopify)</p></li><li data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2197\"><p data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2197\"><strong data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2187\">Cookie Duration:</strong> 30 days</p></li><li data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2239\"><p data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2239\"><strong data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2221\">Payment Schedule:</strong> Monthly payouts</p></li><li data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2347\"><p data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2347\"><strong data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2264\">Affiliate Support:</strong> Dedicated team via <a data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2345\" class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">naidaimrktplace@gmail.com</a></p></li></ul></div></div>",
